flowchart LR
    U([Individual KZT user])
    SF[Smart Finance<br/>Client + Python API]
    DB[(Financial storage<br/>Records, insights, budgets, goals)]
    G[External Gemini provider<br/>Optional receipt inference]
    OPS([Team / local operator<br/>Deploys and configures])
    U -->|Manual records / plans; consented image; confirmation| SF
    SF -->|History / summaries; editable proposals / errors| U
    SF <--> |Read / write user-scoped data| DB
    OPS -->|Local startup / storage config; server-side provider key| SF
    SF -.->|Image + request only after consent| G
    G -.->|Untrusted proposals or controlled failure| SF
